DESCRIPTION >
    Alerts: install-silent check — event count + most recent timestamp,
    trailing 24h, any event type. Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id,
    timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/alerts.js:102 (queryName
    'alert_recent'). Typed-column translation: properties.site_id -> site_id.
    Source has NO event_type filter (matches any event) — preserved exactly,
    not "improved." No JSON-bag fields. IDENTICAL query text to
    integ_recent.pipe (api/routes/integrations.js:146) — duplicate logic,
    Phase-6 consolidation candidate (noted, not acted on).
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE alert_recent_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT count() AS cnt, MAX(timestamp) AS last_ts
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR

TYPE endpoint
